 University, 81528, Aswan, Egypt</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list"> Fatma F. Abdel-Motaal</p></li><li id="Aff4"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Unite of Environmental Studies and Development, Aswan University, 81528, Aswan, Egypt</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list"> Fatma F. Abdel-Motaal</p></li></ol><div class="u-js-hide u-hide-print" data-test="author-info"><span class="c-article__sub-heading">Authors</span><ol class="c-article-authors-search u-list-reset"><li id="auth--Zeinab_Mohamed-Aff1-Aff2"><span class="c-article-authors-search__title u-h3 js-search-name"> Zeinab Mohamed</span><div class="c-article-authors-search__list"><div class="c-article-authors-search__item c-article-authors-search__list-item--left"><a href="/search?sortBy=newestFirst&amp;dc.creator=%20Zeinab%20Mohamed" class="c-article-button" data-track="click" data-track-action="author link - publication" data-track-label="link" rel="nofollow">View author publications</a></div><div class="c-article-authors-search__item c-article-authors-search__list-item--right"><p class="search-in-title-js c-article-authors-search__text"><span class="c-article-authors-search__links-text">Search author on:</span><span class="c-article-identifiers"><a class="c-article-identifiers__item" href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/query.fcgi?cmd=search&amp;term=%20Zeinab%20Mohamed" data-track="click" data-track-action="author link - pubmed" data-track-label="link" rel="nofollow">PubMed</a><span class="u-hide"> </span><a class="c-article-identifiers__item" href="https://scholar.google.co.uk/scholar?as_q=&amp;num=10&amp;btnG=Search+Scholar&amp;as_epq=&amp;as_oq=&amp;as_eq=&amp;as_occt=any&amp;as_sauthors=%22%20Zeinab%20Mohamed%22&amp;as_publication=&amp;as_ylo=&amp;as_yhi=&amp;as_allsubj=all&amp;hl=en" data-track="click" data-track-action="author link - scholar" data-track-label="link" rel="nofollow">Google Scholar</a></span></p></div></div></li><li id="auth--Fatma_F__Abdel_Motaal-Aff3-Aff4"><span class="c-article-authors-search__title u-h3 js-search-name"> Fatma F. Abdel-Motaal</span><div class="c-article-authors-search__list"><div class="c-article-authors-search__item c-article-authors-search__list-item--left"><a href="/search?sortBy=newestFirst&amp;dc.creator=%20Fatma%20F.%20Abdel-Motaal" class="c-article-button" data-track="click" data-track-action="author link - publication" data-track-label="link" rel="nofollow">View author publications</a></div><div class="c-article-authors-search__item c-article-authors-search__list-item--right"><p class="search-in-title-js c-article-authors-search__text"><span class="c-article-authors-search__links-text">Search author on:</span><span class="c-article-identifiers"><a class="c-article-identifiers__item" href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/query.fcgi?cmd=search&amp;term=%20Fatma%20F.%20Abdel-Motaal" data-track="click" data-track-action="author link - pubmed" data-track-label="link" rel="nofollow">PubMed</a><span class="u-hide"> </span><a class="c-article-identifiers__item" href="https://scholar.google.co.uk/scholar?as_q=&amp;num=10&amp;btnG=Search+Scholar&amp;as_epq=&amp;as_oq=&amp;as_eq=&amp;as_occt=any&amp;as_sauthors=%22%20Fatma%20F.%20Abdel-Motaal%22&amp;as_publication=&amp;as_ylo=&amp;as_yhi=&amp;as_allsubj=all&amp;hl=en" data-track="click" data-track-action="author link - scholar" data-track-label="link" rel="nofollow">Google Scholar</a></span></p></div></div></li></ol></div><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="contributions">Contributions</h3><p>Z.M. Designed the study and all technical practical animal model experiments. Tissue Preparations, Blood sampling and analysis, Evaluation of Oxidative Stress Biomarkers, Biochemical Measurements, Histopathological investigations. Data processing analyzed and interpreted the data, Writing-original draft, revision the final manuscript.</p><p>F.F.A. Conceived and designed the study. Isolated and identified the fungus and screened the antifungal activity by seeds extract. Preparation of fungal spores’ suspensions concentrations and seed extracts for rat treatments. Re-isolated the fungus from treated organs. Organized and analyzed the data. Interpreted the data, wrote the paper, and revised the final draft. All authors read and approved the final version after technical drawing and updating the manuscript.</p><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="corresponding-author">Corresponding author</h3><p id="corresponding-author-list">Correspondence to
                <a id="corresp-c1" aria-label="email Zeinab Mohamed" href="mailto:drzeinababdelrahman@sci.aswu.edu.eg"> Zeinab Mohamed</a>.</p></div></div></section><section data-title="Ethics declarations"><div class="c-article-section" id="ethics-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="ethics">Ethics declarations</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="ethics-content">
              
